  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Capacity Building for Roma Inclusion Programs IDF Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the grant is to support capacity building for the National Agency for Roma (NAR), other governmental agencies, central, regional and local authorities to address Roma Issues in inclusive programs. Activities will include: (i) capacity building for inclusive policies, programs and plans formulation consisting of seminars for stakeholders and and technical assistance; (ii) capacity building for NAR to coordinate and monitor initiatives to improve the Roma situation; (iii) information, education and communication. The recipient shall carry out activities through the General Secretariat of the Government and NAR.</narrative>
  </description>
